+#  *** LANDED HERE 2026-10-16 (ledger `cxlaunchquotation`; ruled by Fable 5.1, GPT-6 Astra and Grok 4.7 in
+#  regress/artifacts/adj_20261016/RULINGS_C_records.md, F1).  Until then THIS file ran Astra at `max` with the
